# Outlaw Stitcher: "When this creature enters, create a 2/2 blue and black Zombie Rogue creature token, then put two +1/+1 counters on that
# token for each spell you've cast this turn other than the first." Bot1 casts Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet and Black Lotus, then the Stitcher as
# its fourth spell: three spells other than the first, the Stitcher itself among them, so the Zombie gets six counters (8/8). Spells cast
# are asked of the history, not of what resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Outlaw Stitcher
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

